('telekinetic-force','Telekinetic Force','psychokinesis',NULL,'1 standard action','standard','Medium (100 ft. + 10 ft./level)','One object at a time',NULL,NULL,'Concentration, up to 1 round/level','will','Will negates (object); see text','yes','Yes (object)',5,'Move and manipulate one object at a time with sustained telekinetic force, including the power’s unattended-object break attempt after sufficient concentration.','Each additional PP increases the weight limit by 25 pounds.'),
('telekinetic-maneuver','Telekinetic Maneuver','psychokinesis',NULL,'1 standard action','standard','Medium (100 ft. + 10 ft./level)','One creature',NULL,NULL,'Concentration, up to 1 round/level',NULL,'None','yes',NULL,7,'Use telekinetic force once per round to perform bull rush, disarm, grapple, pin, or trip attempts using manifester level and Intelligence under the power’s special rules.','Every 2 additional PP grants +1 on the maneuver checks.'),
