('telekinetic-thrust','Telekinetic Thrust','psychokinesis',NULL,'1 standard action','standard','Medium (100 ft. + 10 ft./level)','One or more objects or creatures with total weight 250 lb. or less',NULL,NULL,'Instantaneous','will','Will negates or Will negates (object); see text','conditional','Yes or Yes (object); see text',5,'Hurl one or more creatures or objects as projectiles to a distance based on manifester level, resolving attacks and damage under the power’s rules.','Each additional PP increases the total weight limit by 25 pounds.'),
