('temporal-acceleration','Temporal Acceleration','psychoportation',NULL,'1 swift action','swift','Personal','You',NULL,NULL,'1 round in apparent time; see text',NULL,NULL,'no',NULL,11,'Step into an accelerated time frame for one apparent round while other creatures effectively freeze, subject to the power’s restrictions on affecting them.','Every 4 additional PP increases apparent duration by 1 round.'),
